#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:32
msgid ""
"It waves its leaf around to keep foes\n"
"at bay. However, a sweet fragrance also\n"
"wafts from the leaf, creating a friendly\n"
"atmosphere that becalms the battlers."
msgstr ""
"会挥动叶子来驱赶敌人。不过叶子也会散\n"
"发出甜甜的香气，营造出友好的气氛，让\n"
"战斗双方都平静下来。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:102
msgid ""
"A Bayleef's neck is ringed by curled-up\n"
"leaves. Inside each leaf is a small tree\n"
"shoot. The fragrance of this shoot\n"
"makes people peppy."
msgstr ""
"脖子周围环绕着卷起的叶子，每片叶子里\n"
"都有一棵小树芽。树芽的香气会让人精神\n"
"振奋。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:176
msgid ""
"The fragrance of a Meganium's flower\n"
"soothes and calms emotions. In battle,\n"
"it gives off more of its becalming scent\n"
"to blunt the foe's fighting spirit."
msgstr ""
"花朵的香气能抚慰和平复情绪。战斗时，\n"
"它会散发出更多让人平静的香气，削弱对\n"
"手的斗志。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:263
msgid ""
"This Pokémon can fire a tremendously\n"
"powerful Solar Beam from its four\n"
"flowers. Another name for this is\n"
"Mega Sol Cannon."
msgstr ""
"能从四朵花中发射出威力惊人的日光束。\n"
"这招的另一个名字叫超级太阳炮。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:319
msgid ""
"It flares flames from its back to protect\n"
"itself. The fire burns vigorously if the\n"
"Pokémon is angry. When it is tired,\n"
"it sputters with incomplete combustion."
msgstr ""
"会从背上喷出火焰来保护自己。生气时火\n"
"焰燃烧得很旺盛，疲劳时则会因为不完全\n"
"燃烧而噼啪作响。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:390
msgid ""
"It intimidates foes with intense gusts of\n"
"flames and superheated air. Its quick\n"
"nimbleness lets it dodge attacks even\n"
"while scorching an enemy."
msgstr ""
"会用猛烈的火焰和灼热的空气威吓敌人。\n"
"身手敏捷，即使在灼烧敌人时也能躲开攻\n"
"击。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:467
msgid ""
"It can hide behind a shimmering heat haze\n"
"that it creates using its intense flames.\n"
"Typhlosion create blazing explosive\n"
"blasts that burn everything to cinders."
msgstr ""
"能用猛烈的火焰制造出摇曳的热浪，躲藏\n"
"在其中。会引发炽热的爆炸，把一切都烧\n"
"成灰烬。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:536
msgid ""
"Said to purify lost, forsaken souls with\n"
"its flames and guide them to the afterlife.\n"
"It's believed its form was influenced by\n"
"the energy of Mt. Coronet in ancient times."
msgstr ""
"据说会用火焰净化迷途被弃的灵魂，并把\n"
"它们引向阴间。据认为它的样子受到了古\n"
"代天冠山能量的影响。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:604
msgid ""
"Despite its small body, Totodile's jaws\n"
"are very powerful. While it may think it is\n"
"just playfully nipping, its bite has enough\n"
"strength to cause serious injury."
msgstr ""
"虽然身体很小，下颚却非常有力。即使它\n"
"以为只是在开玩笑地轻咬，也足以造成重\n"
"伤。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:678
msgid ""
"Once its jaws clamp down on its foe, it will\n"
"absolutely not let go. Because the tips of\n"
"its fangs are forked back like fishhooks,\n"
"they become irremovably embedded."
msgstr ""
"一旦用下颚咬住敌人，就绝对不会松口。\n"
"因为它的獠牙尖端像鱼钩一样向后弯曲，\n"
"咬进去就拔不出来。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:752
msgid ""
"It opens its huge mouth to intimidate\n"
"enemies. In battle, it runs using its thick\n"
"and powerful hind legs to charge the\n"
"foe with incredible speed."
msgstr ""
"会张开大嘴威吓敌人。战斗时，会用粗壮\n"
"有力的后腿奔跑，以惊人的速度冲向对\n"
"手。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:829
msgid ""
"With its arms and hoodlike fin, this\n"
"Pokémon forms a gigantic set of jaws\n"
"with a bite 10 times as powerful\n"
"as Mega Feraligatr's actual jaws."
msgstr ""
"用手臂和兜帽状的鳍组成巨大的下颚，咬\n"
"合力是超级大力鳄真正下颚的10倍。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:885
msgid ""
"They take turns standing guard when it\n"
"is time to sleep. The sentry awakens the\n"
"others if it senses danger. If one becomes\n"
"separated, it turns sleepless with fear."
msgstr ""
"睡觉时会轮流站岗。站岗的尾立察觉到危\n"
"险时会叫醒同伴。和同伴走散后，会害怕\n"
"得睡不着觉。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:955
msgid ""
"A Furret has a very slim build. When under\n"
"attack, it can squirm through narrow\n"
"spaces and get away. In spite of its short\n"
"limbs, it is very nimble and fleet."
msgstr ""
"身材非常苗条。受到攻击时，能钻过狭窄\n"
"的缝隙逃走。虽然四肢很短，却非常敏\n"
"捷，跑得飞快。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1023
msgid ""
"It has an internal organ that senses\n"
"the earth's rotation. Using this special\n"
"organ, a Hoothoot begins hooting at\n"
"precisely the same time every day."
msgstr ""
"体内有能感知地球自转的器官。依靠这个\n"
"特殊的器官，它每天都会在完全相同的时\n"
"间开始啼叫。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1108
msgid ""
"It unfailingly catches prey in darkness.\n"
"Noctowl owe their success to superior\n"
"vision that allows them to see in minimal\n"
"light, and to their supple and silent wings."
msgstr ""
"在黑暗中也绝不会让猎物逃脱。这多亏了\n"
"它在微光下也能看清的出色视力，以及柔\n"
"软无声的翅膀。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1176
msgid ""
"Ledyba communicate using a fluid that\n"
"they secrete from where the legs join the\n"
"body. They are said to convey feelings to\n"
"others by altering the fluid's scent."
msgstr ""
"会用从腿与身体连接处分泌的液体互相交\n"
"流。据说它们通过改变液体的气味来传达\n"
"感情。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1259
msgid ""
"It is said that in lands with clean air,\n"
"where the stars fill the sky, there live\n"
"many Ledian. For good reason, they use\n"
"the light of the stars as energy."
msgstr ""
"据说在空气清新、繁星满天的地方，住着\n"
"很多安瓢虫。这是因为它们以星光作为能\n"
"量。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1343
msgid ""
"The web it spins can be considered its\n"
"second nervous system. It is said that a\n"
"Spinarak determines its prey by the tiny\n"
"vibrations it feels through the web."
msgstr ""
"它吐出的丝网可以说是它的第二神经系\n"
"统。据说圆丝蛛会通过丝网上传来的细微\n"
"振动来判断猎物。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1423
msgid ""
"Its feet are tipped with tiny hooked claws\n"
"that enable it to scuttle on ceilings and\n"
"vertical walls. It constricts its foe with\n"
"thin and strong silk webbing."
msgstr ""
"脚尖长着细小的钩爪，能在天花板和垂直\n"
"的墙壁上快速爬行。会用又细又结实的丝\n"
"缠紧敌人。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1494
msgid ""
"When it senses danger, it discharges\n"
"positive and negative electricity from its\n"
"two antennae. It lives in depths beyond\n"
"sunlight's reach."
msgstr ""
"察觉到危险时，会从两根触角中放出正电\n"
"和负电。生活在阳光照不到的深海。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1566
msgid ""
"The light-emitting orbs on its back are\n"
"very bright. They are formed from a part of\n"
"its dorsal fin. This Pokémon illuminates\n"
"the inky darkness of deep seas."
msgstr ""
"背上发光的球体非常明亮，是由背鳍的一\n"
"部分变成的。这种宝可梦会照亮漆黑的深\n"
"海。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1640
msgid ""
"As its energy, it uses the feelings of\n"
"compassion and pleasure exuded by\n"
"people and Pokémon. It stores up happy\n"
"feelings in its shell, then shares them out."
msgstr ""
"把人和宝可梦散发出的善意与快乐当作能\n"
"量。它会把幸福的心情储存在壳里，再分\n"
"享给大家。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1710
msgid ""
"It is said to be a Pokémon that brings good\n"
"fortune. When it spots someone who is pure\n"
"of heart, a Togetic appears and shares its\n"
"happiness with that person."
msgstr ""
"据说是会带来好运的宝可梦。发现心灵纯\n"
"洁的人时，就会出现在那个人面前，与对\n"
"方分享幸福。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1789
msgid ""
"As everyone knows, it visits peaceful\n"
"regions, bringing them gifts of kindness\n"
"and sweet blessings. It will never appear\n"
"where there is strife."
msgstr ""
"众所周知，它会造访和平的地区，带去善\n"
"意与甜蜜的祝福。它绝不会出现在有纷争\n"
"的地方。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1864
msgid ""
"It runs up short trees that grow on the\n"
"savanna to peck at new shoots.\n"
"A Natu's eyes look as if they are\n"
"always observing something."
msgstr ""
"会跑上热带草原上生长的矮树，啄食新\n"
"芽。它的眼睛看起来总像是在观察着什\n"
"么。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:1938
msgid ""
"It has the enigmatic power of foreseeing\n"
"the future. Some people in different lands\n"
"have long believed that Xatu are\n"
"emissaries from another world."
msgstr ""
"拥有预知未来的神秘力量。有些地方的人\n"
"们自古以来就相信，天然鸟是来自另一个\n"
"世界的使者。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2023
msgid ""
"Its fluffy wool rubs together and builds\n"
"a static charge. The more energy is\n"
"charged, the more brightly the lightbulb\n"
"at the tip of its tail glows."
msgstr ""
"蓬松的羊毛互相摩擦会积蓄静电。积蓄的\n"
"电量越多，尾巴尖端的灯泡就越亮。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2096
msgid ""
"Its fleece quality changes to generate\n"
"strong static electricity with a small\n"
"amount of wool. The bare, slick parts of its\n"
"hide are shielded against electricity."
msgstr ""
"毛质发生了变化，少量的羊毛就能产生强\n"
"大的静电。皮肤上光滑无毛的部分是绝缘\n"
"的。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2174
msgid ""
"It gives off so much light that it can be\n"
"seen even from space. People in the old\n"
"days used its light to send signals back\n"
"and forth with others far away."
msgstr ""
"发出的光非常强，连在宇宙中都能看见。\n"
"古时候的人们用它的光与远方的人互相传\n"
"递信号。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2249
msgid ""
"Massive amounts of energy intensely\n"
"stimulated Ampharos's cells, apparently\n"
"awakening its long-sleeping dragon's\n"
"blood."
msgstr ""
"大量的能量强烈刺激了电龙的细胞，似乎\n"
"唤醒了它沉睡已久的龙之血脉。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2325
msgid ""
"Its tail, which is packed with nutrition,\n"
"is very bouncy like a rubber ball. On sunny\n"
"days they gather at the edge of water and\n"
"splash about for fun."
msgstr ""
"充满营养的尾巴像橡皮球一样很有弹性。\n"
"晴天时，它们会聚在水边，开心地玩水。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2403
msgid ""
"Its body is covered with water-repellent\n"
"fur. Because of the fur, it can swim\n"
"through water at high speed without being\n"
"slowed by the water's resistance."
msgstr ""
"身体覆盖着防水的毛。多亏了这身毛，它\n"
"能在水中高速游动而不受水的阻力影响。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2485
msgid ""
"It lives in water virtually all day long.\n"
"Its body color and pattern act as\n"
"camouflage that makes it tough for\n"
"enemies to spot in water."
msgstr ""
"几乎一整天都待在水里。身体的颜色和花\n"
"纹能起到伪装的作用，让敌人很难在水中\n"
"发现它。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2557
msgid ""
"Bonsly prefers an arid atmosphere.\n"
"In order to adjust the level of fluids\n"
"in its body, it exudes water from its eyes.\n"
"This makes it appear to be crying."
msgstr ""
"喜欢干燥的环境。为了调节体内的水分，\n"
"会从眼睛里排出水来，所以看起来像在哭\n"
"泣。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2629
msgid ""
"It mimics a tree to avoid being attacked\n"
"by enemies. But since its forelegs\n"
"remain green throughout the year, it is\n"
"easily identified as a fake in the winter."
msgstr ""
"会模仿树木来躲避敌人的攻击。不过因为\n"
"前肢一年四季都是绿色的，到了冬天很容\n"
"易被识破。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2719
msgid ""
"This Pokémon drifts and floats with the\n"
"wind. If it senses the approach of strong\n"
"winds, a Hoppip links leaves with others\n"
"to prepare against being blown away."
msgstr ""
"会随风飘荡。察觉到强风来临时，会和同\n"
"伴的叶子连在一起，防止被吹走。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2794
msgid ""
"It blossoms when the temperature rises\n"
"above 64 degrees F. Because its flower's\n"
"blooming changes with the temperature,\n"
"it is sometimes used as a thermometer."
msgstr ""
"气温超过18度时就会开花。因为花开的程\n"
"度会随气温变化，所以有时会被当作温度\n"
"计使用。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2880
msgid ""
"Jumpluff ride warm southern winds to\n"
"cross the sea and fly to foreign lands.\n"
"This Pokémon lands when it encounters\n"
"cold air while it is floating."
msgstr ""
"会乘着温暖的南风越过大海，飞到外国\n"
"去。飘浮时遇到冷空气就会降落。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:2953
msgid ""
"Its tail ends with a dexterous, handlike\n"
"appendage. However, because it uses the\n"
"tail so much, Aipom's real hands have\n"
"become rather clumsy."
msgstr ""
"尾巴末端长着像手一样灵巧的部分。不过\n"
"因为太常用尾巴了，真正的手反而变得很\n"
"笨拙。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3037
msgid ""
"They live on large trees. Split into two,\n"
"the tails are so adept at handling and\n"
"doing things, Ambipom rarely uses\n"
"its hands now."
msgstr ""
"住在大树上。分成两条的尾巴非常灵巧，\n"
"什么都能做，所以现在几乎不用手了。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3124
msgid ""
"Sunkern try to minimize movement to\n"
"conserve the nutrients they have stored\n"
"in their bodies for evolution. They will\n"
"not eat, subsisting only on morning dew."
msgstr ""
"为了节省体内为进化储存的养分，会尽量\n"
"不动。它什么都不吃，只靠晨露维生。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3200
msgid ""
"Sunflora convert solar energy into\n"
"nutrition. They are highly active in the\n"
"warm daytime but suddenly stop moving as\n"
"soon as the sun sets."
msgstr ""
"能把太阳能转化为养分。在温暖的白天非\n"
"常活跃，但太阳一下山就会突然一动不\n"
"动。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3270
msgid ""
"It can see 360 degrees without moving\n"
"its eyes. It is a great flier capable of\n"
"making sudden stops and turning midair to\n"
"quickly chase down targeted prey."
msgstr ""
"不用转动眼睛就能看到360度的范围。是飞\n"
"行高手，能在空中急停和转弯，迅速追上\n"
"锁定的猎物。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3363
msgid ""
"This six-legged Pokémon is easily capable\n"
"of transporting an adult in flight. It is\n"
"adept at biting apart foes while flying\n"
"by at high speed."
msgstr ""
"长着六条腿的宝可梦，能轻松地带着一个\n"
"成年人飞行。擅长一边高速飞过，一边咬\n"
"碎敌人。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3457
msgid ""
"Wooper usually live in water but come\n"
"out onto land seeking food occasionally.\n"
"On land, they coat their bodies with a\n"
"gooey, toxic film."
msgstr ""
"平时生活在水里，但偶尔也会上岸寻找食\n"
"物。在陆地上时，会用一层黏糊糊的毒膜\n"
"包裹身体。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3540
msgid ""
"A Quagsire hunts by leaving its mouth wide\n"
"open in water and waiting for its prey to\n"
"blunder in. Because it doesn't move, it\n"
"does not get very hungry."
msgstr ""
"会在水中张大嘴巴，等待猎物误闯进来。\n"
"因为它一动不动，所以不太会饿。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3620
msgid ""
"After losing a territorial struggle,\n"
"Wooper began living on land.\n"
"The Pokémon changed over time, developing\n"
"a poisonous film to protect its body."
msgstr ""
"在地盘争夺战中落败后，开始在陆地上生\n"
"活。随着时间推移，它发生了变化，长出\n"
"了保护身体的毒膜。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3687
msgid ""
"When attacked, this Pokémon will\n"
"retaliate by sticking thick spines out\n"
"from its body. It's a risky move\n"
"that puts everything on the line."
msgstr ""
"受到攻击时，会从身体里伸出粗大的刺进\n"
"行反击。这是一种孤注一掷的危险招数。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3757
msgid ""
"Murkrow were feared as the alleged\n"
"bearers of ill fortune. It shows strong\n"
"interest in anything that sparkles. It will\n"
"even try to steal rings from women."
msgstr ""
"曾被人们视为带来厄运的使者而遭到畏\n"
"惧。对闪闪发光的东西非常感兴趣，甚至\n"
"会想去偷女性的戒指。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3843
msgid ""
"Becoming active at night, it is known\n"
"to swarm with numerous Murkrow in tow.\n"
"It is said that it never forgives the\n"
"mistakes of its cronies."
msgstr ""
"会在夜间活动，已知它会带着许多黑暗鸦\n"
"成群行动。据说它绝不会原谅手下犯的错\n"
"误。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3915
msgid ""
"A Misdreavus frightens people with a\n"
"creepy, sobbing cry. It apparently uses\n"
"its red spheres to absorb the fear of foes\n"
"as its nutrition."
msgstr ""
"会发出令人毛骨悚然的抽泣声来吓唬人。\n"
"它似乎会用红色的球体吸收敌人的恐惧作\n"
"为养分。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:3996
msgid ""
"Its cries sound like incantations.\n"
"Those hearing it are tormented by\n"
"headaches and hallucinations.\n"
"It appears where you least expect it."
msgstr ""
"叫声听起来像咒语一样。听到的人会被头\n"
"痛和幻觉折磨。它会出现在意想不到的地\n"
"方。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4170
msgid ""
"A Wynaut loves to eat sweet fruits.\n"
"It cleverly picks fruits using its earlike\n"
"arms. They gather in fruit gardens, drawn\n"
"by the fragrance."
msgstr ""
"最喜欢吃甜甜的果实。会用像耳朵一样的\n"
"手臂灵巧地摘下果实。它们会被香气吸引\n"
"而聚集到果园里。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4243
msgid ""
"Usually docile, a Wobbuffet strikes back\n"
"ferociously if its black tail is attacked.\n"
"It makes its lair in caves where it waits\n"
"for nightfall."
msgstr ""
"平时很温顺，但如果黑色的尾巴受到攻\n"
"击，就会凶猛地反击。会在洞窟里筑巢，\n"
"等待夜幕降临。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4332
msgid ""
"A Girafarig is an herbivore--it eats\n"
"grass and tree shoots. While it is eating,\n"
"its tail makes chewing and swallowing\n"
"motions as if it were also eating."
msgstr ""
"是食草动物，以草和树芽为食。在它进食\n"
"时，尾巴也会做出咀嚼和吞咽的动作，就\n"
"像也在吃东西一样。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4417
msgid ""
"Now that the brain waves from the\n"
"head and tail are synced up, the\n"
"psychic power of this Pokémon is 10\n"
"times stronger than Girafarig's."
msgstr ""
"头部和尾巴的脑电波变得同步，这种宝可\n"
"梦的超能力是麒麟奇的10倍。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4483
msgid ""
"A Pineco hangs from a tree branch and\n"
"waits for prey. While eating, if it is\n"
"disturbed by someone shaking its tree, it\n"
"falls on the ground and suddenly explodes."
msgstr ""
"会挂在树枝上等待猎物。进食时，如果有\n"
"人摇晃树木打扰它，它就会掉到地上突然\n"
"爆炸。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4557
msgid ""
"It keeps itself inside its steel shell.\n"
"The shell is opened when it is catching\n"
"prey, but it is so quick that the shell's\n"
"inside cannot be seen."
msgstr ""
"总是待在钢铁外壳里。捕捉猎物时会打开\n"
"外壳，但速度快得让人看不到壳里面的样\n"
"子。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4633
msgid ""
"Its drill-tipped tail is used to burrow into\n"
"the ground backwards. This Pokémon is\n"
"known to make its nest in complex shapes\n"
"deep under the ground."
msgstr ""
"会用钻头般的尾巴倒着钻进地里。已知它\n"
"会在地下深处筑造形状复杂的巢穴。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4708
msgid ""
"This Pokémon uses its hard tail to\n"
"make its nest by boring holes into\n"
"bedrock deep underground. The nest\n"
"can reach lengths of over six miles."
msgstr ""
"会用坚硬的尾巴在地下深处的岩床上钻洞\n"
"筑巢。巢穴的长度能达到10公里以上。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4772
msgid ""
"A recent study uncovered that the\n"
"number of segments a Dudunsparce's\n"
"body has is determined by the\n"
"Pokémon's genes."
msgstr ""
"最近的研究发现，土龙节节身体的节数是\n"
"由基因决定的。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4839
msgid ""
"It glides without making a single sound.\n"
"It grasps the face of its foe using its\n"
"hind and large front claws, then stabs\n"
"with its poison barb."
msgstr ""
"滑翔时不会发出一点声音。会用后腿和巨\n"
"大的前爪抓住敌人的脸，然后用毒针刺下\n"
"去。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:4925
msgid ""
"Gliscor observes prey while hanging\n"
"upside down from branches. Its flight is\n"
"soundless. When the chance presents\n"
"itself, it swoops!"
msgstr ""
"会倒挂在树枝上观察猎物。飞行时没有一\n"
"点声音。一旦有机可乘，就会俯冲下去！"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5001
msgid ""
"By baring its fangs and making a scary\n"
"face, it sends smaller Pokémon scurrying\n"
"in terror. The Snubbull does seem a\n"
"little sad at making its foes flee."
msgstr ""
"露出獠牙做出可怕的表情，就能吓跑比自\n"
"己小的宝可梦。不过把对手吓跑后，布鲁\n"
"似乎也有点难过。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5077
msgid ""
"It has a particularly well-developed lower\n"
"jaw. The huge fangs are heavy, causing\n"
"it to tilt its head. Unless it is startled,\n"
"it will not try to bite."
msgstr ""
"下颚特别发达。巨大的獠牙很重，所以它\n"
"总是歪着头。只要不受到惊吓，它就不会\n"
"咬人。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5152
msgid ""
"A Qwilfish uses the pressure of water\n"
"it swallows to shoot toxic quills all at\n"
"once from all over its body. It finds\n"
"swimming to be somewhat challenging."
msgstr ""
"会利用吞下的水的压力，从全身一齐射出\n"
"带毒的刺。它似乎不太擅长游泳。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5229
msgid ""
"A form of Qwilfish from the distant past.\n"
"Fishers detest this troublesome Pokémon\n"
"because it sprays poison from its spines,\n"
"getting it everywhere."
msgstr ""
"远古时代的千针鱼。它会从刺中喷出毒\n"
"液，弄得到处都是，所以渔民们非常讨厌\n"
"这种麻烦的宝可梦。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5298
msgid ""
"Its lancelike spikes and savage\n"
"temperament have earned it the\n"
"nickname “Sea Fiend”.\n"
"It slurps up poison to nourish itself."
msgstr ""
"长枪般的尖刺和凶猛的性情，让它得到了\n"
"“海之恶魔”的外号。会吸食毒素作为营\n"
"养。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5371
msgid ""
"A Shuckle hides under rocks, keeping its\n"
"body concealed inside its shell while\n"
"eating stored berries. The berries mix with\n"
"its body fluids to become a juice."
msgstr ""
"躲在岩石下，把身体藏在壳里，吃储存的\n"
"树果。树果和它的体液混合后会变成果\n"
"汁。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5441
msgid ""
"They gather in forests seeking the sweet\n"
"sap of trees. It is completely clad in a\n"
"steel-hard shell. It is proud of its horn,\n"
"which it uses to fling foes."
msgstr ""
"会为了寻找甜甜的树液而聚集到森林里。\n"
"全身覆盖着钢铁般坚硬的外壳。它引以为\n"
"豪的角能把敌人甩飞。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5531
msgid ""
"A tremendous influx of energy builds it up,\n"
"but when Mega Evolution ends, Heracross\n"
"is bothered by terrible soreness in its\n"
"muscles."
msgstr ""
"大量涌入的能量让它变得强大，但超级进\n"
"化结束后，赫拉克罗斯会被剧烈的肌肉酸\n"
"痛所困扰。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5605
msgid ""
"A Sneasel scales trees by punching its\n"
"hooked claws into the bark. It seeks out\n"
"unguarded nests and steals eggs for food\n"
"while the parents are away."
msgstr ""
"会把钩爪插进树皮里爬树。它会寻找无人\n"
"看守的巢穴，趁父母不在时偷走蛋作为食\n"
"物。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5697
msgid ""
"They travel in groups of four or five,\n"
"leaving signs for one another on trees\n"
"and rocks. They bring down their prey\n"
"with coordinated attacks."
msgstr ""
"以四五只为一群行动，会在树木和岩石上\n"
"留下记号互相联络。它们会用默契的配合\n"
"攻击打倒猎物。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5780
msgid ""
"Its sturdy, curved claws are ideal for\n"
"traversing precipitous cliffs. From the\n"
"tips of these claws drips a venom that\n"
"infiltrates the nerves of any prey caught."
msgstr ""
"结实弯曲的爪子非常适合攀爬陡峭的悬\n"
"崖。爪尖会滴落一种毒液，能侵入被抓住\n"
"的猎物的神经。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5862
msgid ""
"Because of its wicked poison and daunting\n"
"physical prowess, no other species could\n"
"hope to best it on frozen highlands. It\n"
"prefers solitude and doesn't form packs."
msgstr ""
"凭借恶毒的毒素和惊人的身体能力，在冰\n"
"冻的高原上没有其他物种能战胜它。它喜\n"
"欢独处，不会成群结队。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:5934
msgid ""
"It licks its palms that are sweetened by\n"
"being soaked in honey. A Teddiursa makes\n"
"its own honey by blending fruits and pollen\n"
"collected by Beedrill."
msgstr ""
"会舔被蜂蜜浸得甜甜的手掌。熊宝宝会把\n"
"果实和大针蜂收集的花粉混在一起，酿造\n"
"出自己的蜂蜜。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6006
msgid ""
"In forests, it is said that there are many\n"
"streams and towering trees where an\n"
"Ursaring gathers food. It walks through\n"
"its forest collecting food every day."
msgstr ""
"据说圈圈熊采集食物的森林里有许多溪流\n"
"和参天大树。它每天都会在森林里四处走\n"
"动采集食物。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6091
msgid ""
"Swampy terrain gives Ursaluna its burly\n"
"physique and newfound capacity to\n"
"manipulate peat at will."
msgstr ""
"沼泽地带让它拥有了魁梧的体格，并获得\n"
"了随意操控泥炭的新能力。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6155
msgid ""
"It crossed the sea and drifted\n"
"ashore in a new land. Surviving in this\n"
"place led it to take on a unique\n"
"appearance and gain special powers."
msgstr ""
"漂洋过海，漂流到了新的土地上。为了在\n"
"这里生存下去，它拥有了独特的外表和特\n"
"殊的力量。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6222
msgid ""
"It is a species of Pokémon that lives in\n"
"volcanic areas. If its body cools, its skin\n"
"hardens and immobilizes it. To avoid that,\n"
"it sleeps near magma."
msgstr ""
"生活在火山地带的宝可梦。身体一冷却，\n"
"皮肤就会变硬无法动弹。为了避免这种情\n"
"况，它会睡在岩浆附近。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6300
msgid ""
"The shell on its back is made of hardened\n"
"magma. Tens of thousands of years spent\n"
"living in volcanic craters have turned\n"
"Magcargo's bodies into magma."
msgstr ""
"背上的壳是由凝固的岩浆形成的。在火山\n"
"口生活了数万年，让熔岩蜗牛的身体变成\n"
"了岩浆。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6375
msgid ""
"It roots for food by rubbing its snout\n"
"against the ground. Its favorite food is a\n"
"mushroom that grows under dried grass.\n"
"It occasionally roots out hot springs."
msgstr ""
"会用鼻子蹭着地面寻找食物。最喜欢吃长\n"
"在枯草下的蘑菇。偶尔还会挖出温泉来。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6450
msgid ""
"A Piloswine is covered by a thick coat\n"
"of long hair for enduring freezing cold.\n"
"It uses its tusks to dig up food that has\n"
"been buried under ice."
msgstr ""
"全身覆盖着厚厚的长毛，能忍耐严寒。会\n"
"用獠牙挖出埋在冰下的食物。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6541
msgid ""
"A frozen Mamoswine was dug from ice\n"
"dating back 10,000 years. It woke up to\n"
"much amazement. This Pokémon has been\n"
"around for a long, long, long time."
msgstr ""
"从1万年前的冰层中挖出了被冻住的象牙\n"
"猪。它醒过来时让人们大吃一惊。这种宝\n"
"可梦存在了非常非常久。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6630
msgid ""
"Corsola live in warm southern seas.\n"
"If the sea becomes polluted, the beautiful\n"
"coral stalks become discolored and crumble\n"
"away in tatters."
msgstr ""
"生活在温暖的南方海域。如果海水被污\n"
"染，美丽的珊瑚枝就会褪色，变得残破不\n"
"堪。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6702
msgid ""
"Sudden climate change wiped out this\n"
"ancient kind of Corsola. With its branches,\n"
"it absorbs others' life-force. It curses\n"
"those unaware that kick it by accident."
msgstr ""
"因突如其来的气候变化而灭绝的古代太阳\n"
"珊瑚。会用枝条吸取其他生物的生命力。\n"
"会诅咒不小心踢到它的人。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6770
msgid ""
"Its shell is overflowing with its\n"
"heightened otherworldly energy. The\n"
"ectoplasm serves as protection for this\n"
"Pokémon's core spirit."
msgstr ""
"壳里充满了增强后的灵界能量。这些灵质\n"
"保护着它的核心灵魂。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6840
msgid ""
"A Remoraid uses its abdominal muscles\n"
"to forcefully expel swallowed water, then\n"
"shoot down flying prey. When evolution\n"
"approaches, it travels down rivers."
msgstr ""
"会用腹部的肌肉把吞下的水猛力喷出，击\n"
"落飞行中的猎物。快要进化时，会顺着河\n"
"流游下去。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6914
msgid ""
"It ensnares its foe with its suction-\n"
"cupped tentacles before delivering the\n"
"finishing blow. If the foe turns out to be\n"
"too strong, it spews ink to escape."
msgstr ""
"会用带吸盘的触手缠住敌人，再给予最后\n"
"一击。如果发现敌人太强，就会喷出墨汁\n"
"逃跑。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:6999
msgid ""
"It carries food bundled up in its tail.\n"
"There was a famous explorer who\n"
"managed to scale Mt. Everest thanks\n"
"to a Delibird sharing its food."
msgstr ""
"会用尾巴把食物包起来搬运。曾有一位著\n"
"名的探险家，多亏了信使鸟分给他食物，\n"
"才成功登上了珠穆朗玛峰。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7070
msgid ""
"When it swims close to the surface\n"
"of the ocean, people aboard ships are\n"
"able to observe the pattern on its back.\n"
"It often swims in a school of Remoraid."
msgstr ""
"在靠近海面的地方游泳时，船上的人能看\n"
"到它背上的花纹。经常和铁炮鱼群一起游\n"
"泳。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7148
msgid ""
"On sunny days, schools of Mantine can be\n"
"seen elegantly leaping over the waves.\n"
"It is not bothered by the Remoraid that\n"
"hitches rides."
msgstr ""
"晴天时，能看到成群的巨翅飞鱼优雅地跃\n"
"过海浪。它并不在意搭便车的铁炮鱼。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7221
msgid ""
"A Pokémon that has a body and wings of\n"
"steel. People in the past used feathers\n"
"fallen from Skarmory to make swords and\n"
"knives."
msgstr ""
"身体和翅膀都是钢铁的宝可梦。过去，人\n"
"们会用盔甲鸟掉落的羽毛来制作刀剑。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7296
msgid ""
"Due to the effects of Mega Evolution,\n"
"its pincers have taken a more\n"
"diabolical form, ripping anything\n"
"they pierce to shreds."
msgstr ""
"受超级进化的影响，钳子变成了更加凶恶\n"
"的形状，会把刺中的东西撕成碎片。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7353
msgid ""
"Houndour communicate with each other\n"
"using a variety of cries to corner their\n"
"prey. This Pokémon's remarkable teamwork\n"
"is simply unparalleled."
msgstr ""
"会用各种叫声互相交流，把猎物逼入绝\n"
"境。这种宝可梦出色的团队合作是无与伦\n"
"比的。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7421
msgid ""
"In a Houndoom pack, the one with its horns\n"
"raked sharply back serves a leadership\n"
"role. They choose their leader by fighting\n"
"among themselves."
msgstr ""
"在黑鲁加的群体中，角向后弯曲得最尖锐\n"
"的那只是首领。它们会通过互相争斗来选\n"
"出首领。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7507
msgid ""
"Its red claws and the tips of its tail are\n"
"melting from high internal temperatures\n"
"that are painful to Houndoom itself.\n"
msgstr ""
"红色的爪子和尾巴尖端因为体内的高温而\n"
"熔化，连黑鲁加自己都感到很痛苦。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7577
msgid ""
"Phanpy's big ears serve as broad fans.\n"
"When it becomes hot, it flaps the ears\n"
"busily to cool down. Even the young are\n"
"very strong."
msgstr ""
"大大的耳朵就像宽大的扇子。天热时，它\n"
"会不停地扇动耳朵来降温。即使是幼崽，\n"
"力气也非常大。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7651
msgid ""
"A Donphan is so strong it can easily haul\n"
"a dump truck. Its hide has toughened to a\n"
"rock-hard state. An ordinary sort of\n"
"attack won't even leave a scratch."
msgstr ""
"力气大到能轻松拖动自卸卡车。皮肤已经\n"
"变得像岩石一样坚硬，普通的攻击连一道\n"
"划痕都留不下。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7737
msgid ""
"Stantler's magnificent antlers were\n"
"once traded at high prices as works of art.\n"
"As a result, this Pokémon was hunted\n"
"close to extinction."
msgstr ""
"它华丽的角曾被当作艺术品高价交易，因\n"
"此这种宝可梦遭到滥捕，几乎濒临灭绝。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7809
msgid ""
"The black orbs shine with an uncanny light\n"
"when it is erecting invisible barriers.\n"
"The fur shed from its beard retains heat\n"
"and is useful for winter clothing."
msgstr ""
"在张开无形的屏障时，黑色的球体会发出\n"
"诡异的光芒。胡须上脱落的毛很保暖，可\n"
"以用来制作冬衣。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7880
msgid ""
"A Smeargle marks its territory using a\n"
"fluid that leaks out from the tip of its\n"
"tail. About 5,000 different marks left by\n"
"this Pokémon have been found."
msgstr ""
"会用从尾巴尖端渗出的液体来标记自己的\n"
"领地。已经发现了它留下的大约5000种不\n"
"同的记号。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:7957
msgid ""
"It gives over five gallons of milk daily.\n"
"Its sweet milk is enjoyed by children and\n"
"grown-ups alike. People who can't drink\n"
"milk turn it into yogurt and eat it instead."
msgstr ""
"每天能产出20升以上的牛奶。它甜甜的牛\n"
"奶深受大人和小孩的喜爱。不能喝牛奶的\n"
"人会把它做成酸奶来吃。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8037
msgid ""
"Raikou embodies the speed of lightning.\n"
"Its roars send shock waves shuddering\n"
"through the air and ground as if\n"
"lightning bolts were crashing down."
msgstr ""
"雷公体现了雷电的速度。它的咆哮会像落\n"
"雷一样，让冲击波震撼空气和大地。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8119
msgid ""
"Entei embodies the passion of magma.\n"
"It is thought to have been born in the\n"
"eruption of a volcano. It blasts fire that\n"
"consumes all that it touches."
msgstr ""
"炎帝体现了岩浆的热情。据认为它是在火\n"
"山喷发时诞生的。它喷出的火焰会烧尽碰\n"
"到的一切。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8200
msgid ""
"Suicune embodies the compassion of\n"
"a pure spring of water. It runs across\n"
"the land with gliding elegance. It has the\n"
"power to purify dirty water."
msgstr ""
"水君体现了清澈泉水的慈爱。它会优雅地\n"
"在大地上滑行奔跑。拥有净化污水的力\n"
"量。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8270
msgid ""
"A Larvitar is born deep under the ground.\n"
"It must eat its way through the soil above\n"
"and reach the surface for it to see its\n"
"parents' faces."
msgstr ""
"诞生在地下深处。它必须吃掉上方的泥土\n"
"钻到地面上，才能见到父母的脸。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8340
msgid ""
"A Pupitar creates a gas inside its body\n"
"that it ejects under compression to propel\n"
"itself like a jet. Its body can withstand\n"
"a collision with solid steel."
msgstr ""
"会在体内制造气体，压缩后喷出，像喷气\n"
"机一样推动自己前进。它的身体能承受与\n"
"坚硬钢铁的碰撞。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8413
msgid ""
"A Tyranitar is so overwhelmingly powerful,\n"
"it can bring down a whole mountain to make\n"
"its nest. It roams in mountains seeking\n"
"new opponents to fight."
msgstr ""
"拥有压倒性的力量，能推倒一整座山来筑\n"
"巢。会在山中徘徊，寻找新的对手。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8488
msgid ""
"Due to the colossal power poured into it,\n"
"this Pokémon's back split right open. Its\n"
"destructive instincts are the only thing\n"
"keeping it moving."
msgstr ""
"由于被注入了巨大的力量，它的背部裂开\n"
"了。现在只有破坏的本能在驱使它行动。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8565
msgid ""
"Lugia is so powerful even a light\n"
"fluttering of its wings can blow apart\n"
"houses. As a result, it chooses to live out\n"
"of sight deep under the sea."
msgstr ""
"力量强大到只需轻轻扇动翅膀就能把房屋\n"
"吹散。因此它选择在深海中过着不为人知\n"
"的生活。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8656
msgid ""
"Its feathers--which glow in seven colors\n"
"depending on the angle at which they are\n"
"struck by light--are thought to bring joy.\n"
"It is said to live at the foot of a rainbow."
msgstr ""
"它的羽毛会随着光照角度的不同而发出七\n"
"彩光芒，据说能带来幸福。据说它住在彩\n"
"虹的尽头。"

#: src/data/pokemon/species_info/gen_2_families.h:8736
msgid ""
"This Pokémon came from the future by\n"
"crossing over time. It is thought that so\n"
"long as Celebi appears, a bright and\n"
"shining future awaits us."
msgstr ""
"跨越时间从未来来到这里的宝可梦。据认\n"
"为只要时拉比出现，就会有光明灿烂的未\n"
"来等着我们。"

